{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "batch": 1360,
  "batch_count": 1645,
  "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
  "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
  "source_language": "zh-CN",
  "entries": [
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c1f0f8d4bdea439f08d177a0",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "百花齐放的季节到了呢☆★\r\n我会变成怎样的我？\r\n又会遇见怎样的你呢？好期待～☆",
      "source_fingerprint": "e7ff5c5476ed37af32802b88b8069f161f48d2eb0fc4d06009a3da85b39be419",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1055",
        "90006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4683cc1dae7f7a92051d8e73",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "大海！高山！露营！星空！\r\n充满冒险气息，雀跃无比的预感☆★\r\n今年也要尽～情享受哦♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "acafdf07dfe31018a22210a1d6060eba387f030048929f40e3fbb01b2b8b9a4c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1055",
        "90007"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:953609be42d88e52dc8f5651",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "食欲之秋☆★是答谢自己的\r\n身体的季节！尽情大啖\r\n美味又美丽的东西吧☆",
      "source_fingerprint": "8ac1262e97b49be894bc5b83d9d40abcb434d4868aa97eed73ad2eebd3103185",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1055",
        "90008"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:59cc257a5bc6c5909980fd8d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "很冷吗？很冷吗？让我来温暖你☆\r\n首先把热气呼在手中！\r\n冬天就是个互助的季节呢★☆★",
      "source_fingerprint": "a77f21f3e6d79c95b6699b3ec66a5e716484c7cf9b03d46db870611d36bc35bd",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1055",
        "90009"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a2a0e5d8f162615741aac00b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "情人节快乐☆",
      "source_fingerprint": "7ab75641234eb92578f96bb4f99aab9c2ec0716fb0943e8e752e2141a30a90be",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1055",
        "90020"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2e9d626deaaaa7a5c97573e5",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "只要桂冠拍拍我的头，\r\n睡意立刻就会涌上来！\r\n呼噜呼噜～～昏昏欲睡～～♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "c8541844f44eaafeb894543afbb4db9925863a48a0a89b3753f40a6afb6173b6",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1055",
        "91000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:987d236920f05a4bfbe457f2",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "奶奶是美丽师父☆\r\n拥有相当强大的美丽之力！\r\n是我的目标★☆★",
      "source_fingerprint": "96ea0d31023dc88e8766082cb6929e51f5360f9b775d09b07b7220a3f912f22f",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1055",
        "91001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0a06f91fbdc5018d8e5e98ea",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "训练员，一～起玩吧☆★\r\n……啊，工作很忙？那我可以\r\n在这里看着吗～？……可以吗？",
      "source_fingerprint": "98cc8c6200ff63250d7fe6ea5f60ed00922fee6bda75de1f78dffb9a6d65d460",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1055",
        "91002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d7abd093f202ccd399391c9f",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "当我内心感到寒冷时，就会去\r\n找白仁！她会一语不发地让我\r\n待在她身旁……那份温柔很温暖呢☆",
      "source_fingerprint": "3aaca1d74ea0268b1f1418ee31af40c2626654633f59db2ed17d89357e5c6eb6",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1055",
        "91003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5cba0e96352ce0e94b3fed88",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我每次开心☆到克制不住时，就会\r\n不小心倒下！素质总是会说「你也\r\n替负责回收你的我想想！」嘿嘿★",
      "source_fingerprint": "db52aa12928bda621f0b2b569ea52988f33e92b2f0428292f83875b18f146a32",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1055",
        "91004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1a118c251bbfdecc985516e7",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我最──喜欢演唱会了☆★☆\r\n每个人闪耀动人的意志、努力的\r\n结晶……到处都洋溢着美丽★",
      "source_fingerprint": "4fa8fe5d4ed0e429354db0282556677813d25871d928a0ff3b3a05f85094bd0e",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1055",
        "91005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d16b53d07ca9765a3ad7a78d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我很喜欢裙襬的波浪皱褶☆★☆\r\n打开的时候是不是很像一朵花？\r\n转呀转～♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "2083516620db867511b41baad56b7b30c01c0ddd187b1e7d5602997fb0f31d54",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1055",
        "91006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a417f818803fe1f895f3863f",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "每个人的内心都有美好的种子！\r\n而这件决胜服就饱含了希望那些\r\n种子能够开出美丽花朵的祈愿哦☆",
      "source_fingerprint": "b1bf5e1050d345dc7adc9b206f5d73a310e3a61e291f0b1720454d4ab739a9cf",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1055",
        "91007"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ad17941fd6468ecfc425776e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "色彩缤纷就是这件决胜服的看点☆★\r\n看着它心情就会闪耀动人，对吧？\r\n接着就会有美丽的发展☆★",
      "source_fingerprint": "606a1bbd7019d68064927bb5a7895ecbac69abb3e2bc0d8daa2e2ddbb8e128ba",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1055",
        "91008"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b65e272eb4dd7fe701ad376d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我很推荐早起☆去散步、打扫！\r\n让身心都舒畅★早餐也会变得\r\n更加美味哦★☆",
      "source_fingerprint": "fa13937d0a7be2d3dd228ccdb735529b3475a44fc7aa2e3d50c3990a7459b86b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1055",
        "91009"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5613d0b42024a38e23f789ca",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我们班上每个月会换一次座位！\r\n课程中充满了许多雀跃无比的未知☆\r\n所以我总是想在最前面的座位听课★",
      "source_fingerprint": "b94b5bb80e5ae7a55e3420ff01324e0d578b1b471201fe7f638f6336c7adbeab",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1055",
        "91010"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ca1a4e5a6c2e62e3bd6d4e93",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "宿舍的大厅既热闹又欢乐☆★\r\n当素质晚回来的时候，\r\n我就会在大厅等她哦～",
      "source_fingerprint": "f7aaf0acc34d8b0c4bf44f6f5ce4bb6d4a741c097bae5ed7ab400c63781b3b67",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1055",
        "91011"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7bffd70d04d2b2bb2d7a4055",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "相遇和离别，旅途和挑战☆\r\n春天总是会让我们的未来\r\n变得丰富起来呢★☆",
      "source_fingerprint": "41aaa150a9419391e2bf0fa17f6d13ed8f47b696adcf0f96033d826888a985ab",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1055",
        "91012"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:490c5da74e69c9b93a03bb52",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "鬼怪会告诉我们隐藏在\r\n这个世界里的神秘……\r\n与它们交谈后，一定能有所发现☆",
      "source_fingerprint": "42f278be68b919d0d4ce421c2e131416391a965649a0fc7b65de9c732f4aa234",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1055",
        "91013"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4446f276cc193f36de538277",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "有好──多枫叶☆★红通通的一片\r\n闪耀动人♪阳光照射下更闪耀动人♪\r\n看得我心跳加速♪最～喜欢枫叶了！",
      "source_fingerprint": "e452de01744dbbeec0a38b5f52cbe9e91d181e2db07967402efa55568e671738",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1055",
        "91014"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5344141502572079a2b81763",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "顺利克服寒冬的蔬菜\r\n吃起来非～常甘甜又美丽！\r\n而我们也一定会苦尽甘来呢☆★",
      "source_fingerprint": "1f5f3d7b40ed531e3c2139633a30145042b660c800aaf3265dde289d4e954488",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1055",
        "91015"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:35daf0f5db0f79eb118ecd57",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "口号是？美丽～～☆★\r\n嗯嗯，那就开始吧──！",
      "source_fingerprint": "a085d7519ea11ccf76e9f62c361b66e6a726b3d2be14966a8ad99f5bb0412c4d",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1055",
        "92000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:069810b5e9403b37a0d1a61b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "いっくよー！",
      "source_fingerprint": "4f0aa2f086dc0e4b0ae5d07fbac8985c40a2f3b08abeafcfef574ccd57681b13",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1055",
        "920000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:02aa087456c9c5779696ac7f",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "训练就像是在种植美丽☆★\r\n令人雀跃无比呢♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "b3e8a67a107ec5ca19ffd105952e3bca8aa6c95d8921b0ae5af596b9b4e15f16",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1055",
        "92001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7c92de2290887f8c5275413e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "今天的训练项目是什么？\r\n在等待着答案揭晓的这段时间，\r\n总是让我雀跃无比呢♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "5e50a4bee3d5b5dda558a95bc50a63fca8490f6d8cea04388f85e561b3ed5635",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1055",
        "92002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:84d29c902f111785442cba47",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "虽然现在的我已经出色又美丽☆\r\n不过如果我变得更强……？\r\n就会变得更～加美丽～☆★对吧？",
      "source_fingerprint": "1b585ea4bc77589e579ba548dc606178cd70bb0eb5d5067d847bac6611e93d7e",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1055",
        "92003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a29039d3b713c9ce3c9505fe",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "多亏了训练员，我的美丽不断地\r\n在累积！今天也要累积很多美丽哦！\r\n麻烦你啰☆★",
      "source_fingerprint": "92f0686c895c8f638f1e0a4a0d1b802e5087d60c86f90a856a8394785fce2f03",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1055",
        "92005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ecd09357b9b8a5d6a8e8c560",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "齐心协力是件非常特别\r\n又美好的事☆★因为这证明了\r\n彼此的心紧紧相连嘛☆",
      "source_fingerprint": "b0c6fbf983fce9dc0e84d3d9e8ba38890d82f0302e6cc6eb96cbc9289c4609ff",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1055",
        "92006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a4bbf9bcc98a32d1c69baf3d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "朝向比美丽……\r\n更遥远的美丽迈进！\r\n如果跟你一起绝对办得到☆★",
      "source_fingerprint": "fa47e5ad8a3583214fdd6b4ca1d86459b36fd9c043608b3b57c2bbd3a00a970f",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1055",
        "92007"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d79f3125919669a8b71a2e5b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "谢谢太阳公公──！\r\n毕竟太阳公公是孕育我们的光芒☆\r\n必须向这炎热的阳光献上感谢呢★",
      "source_fingerprint": "a93d61c64e2aa3986afde1f12dac642d5ff013730fabd20d0881cf1fcd4c5133",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1055",
        "92011"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e89a55b3b8a4361f19b53e7c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我与你的美丽！\r\n让这个世界变得如此灿烂☆★☆",
      "source_fingerprint": "f2a76464d0a0a8f268ead411534a623b5e7e8879bcf519a5eaa293923f6f26b3",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1055",
        "93000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e8741e01e1685b60d759f544",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "美丽的影响范围扩大了呢☆",
      "source_fingerprint": "b1571dc29f99f72d69cb61667f23151c63f2a44f5ba7992bee776b5531d02f0f",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1055",
        "93001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:69cb2d77e928266b9f5d95f1",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "美丽提──升☆★☆",
      "source_fingerprint": "6326ecfb4f97d0b73deb56e4ed1d2355de6bbda2f7584c6046c8732192bd20f8",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1055",
        "95000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b7afc22791068e541a7cb80e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "美丽……是无限大☆★☆",
      "source_fingerprint": "4b3160463c172eb118ad7952da1c179d4549501243249aeb6febdd40562d650e",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1055",
        "95001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:315946c8513f177f0f86ec2d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "哈啰～！我是美丽周日唷☆★",
      "source_fingerprint": "d2455c55b2874c3d1b99f70d8ac7b2b4362c3103fef48db82e17cbabd8317148",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1055",
        "95003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9218f58a5e54748e48dccada",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "无论你我☆无论今天明天，\r\n世界总会是如此美丽★☆",
      "source_fingerprint": "5fc425b13f66e16f42fc29fb7e18129e9044d785caef2c3af61d4002ffeec630",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1055",
        "95004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:de8ac9c4d751c5dfaf4b5f5e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我会让你变得很美丽☆",
      "source_fingerprint": "f163a31d2e468b3cf5d25d4ec17a016573954a3748ad33ccda6e8d3bad73e680",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1055",
        "95005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4c9468dea567b7ed6bf7d84d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "美丽大爆发～★",
      "source_fingerprint": "036af71b1c116abe397a3f33c2b421c599ee0af8e3cc2eaed36e60a90b1efa76",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1055",
        "95006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7eae5bdff396311a17049e07",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "南无，菠菜！",
      "source_fingerprint": "43156ca9db7a3b350bf96c8414d752f6fcad155cc247b529ebde9008179bc2ee",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1056",
        "1000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ef7bcdb9dc58a35bf3ff4400",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "虽然我的实力还远远不够……\r\n但只要相信占卜跟训练员，\r\n我就能努力的！",
      "source_fingerprint": "02f39afbf4a902a7d731992e9c2c55feb6cc5bb9b7e97d3dd6e7ce3e83256b7a",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1056",
        "10000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:35874a46938279a68dea185e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "行ってきまーす！",
      "source_fingerprint": "2d78986101146d6de35ea8b61c365b98edb4995f82bc4377fc115f71846af476",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1056",
        "100000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d87796654c21771a935428a4",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "ただいまです！",
      "source_fingerprint": "26ad933f266e4edc277a5308b72152820d9744d306e6d10c455cea8191d7e459",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1056",
        "100001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7c69324ee1d2564e0dfba12d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "果然训练员就是我命中注定的人！\r\n占卜结果跟我的直觉都是这么说的！",
      "source_fingerprint": "31d987a34015b17c4447850bf02c2f4dea2a81dc8ac9c9842e7381994f70229f",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1056",
        "10001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9ff49b1df2cc0ba3e583773a",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "丢掉好多杂物，畅快多了～！\r\n转换心情，愉快地掌握福气吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "832d481a3971947cdc966dad9d4ca1540f49cc0e4fde4733f69d6d16c1273f2f",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1056",
        "10002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2094961af5d218fc6a5e8be0",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "嘿咻！咚咚！福气来临！\r\n新年就要带着笑容，\r\n用闪亮又万里无云的心情迈进！！",
      "source_fingerprint": "334a9a81bbc87af293f19e81eaa6ea2c8c46801b698e218016b1ebb380fbecee",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1056",
        "10003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f4ebe6e00799b0dbc2c8f93e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "因为看到在卖幸运饼干我就买了！\r\n为了看里面的幸运签，\r\n必须要吃很多的幸运饼干才行……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "c591b6546254945f0b1c72296b1dac8df52d9db4e8ba66d73defbdc3580d71dd",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1056",
        "10004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c2aabe9458a5e0b14de3b8d4",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "因为是情人节嘛，\r\n我就做了护身符形状的巧克力……\r\n请收下！",
      "source_fingerprint": "1156709163bf1dcfc4b1b1448965d28d8ba021d4af4c011858b1d790eceab352",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1056",
        "10005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b7cf90f1551fedd1abdbfeb0",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我会送竹子跟签纸去训练员房间的！\r\n你就尽情在上面写下你的愿望吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "b63d985574762e7ba869764f64bc62829a0f38ee0c4b97d5aa84a1642f6c47dc",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1056",
        "10006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6ee4728881ebe1fc9af51ef1",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "要来玩咬苹果吗？\r\n听说是要用嘴咬起浮在水上的苹果，\r\n是用来占卜恋情的方法哦。",
      "source_fingerprint": "758c62d6edccdd5f103f244fda09615c68b7c740eb2658702e9ef51b5a3cbcf8",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1056",
        "10007"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:424ce6116571358c7e2a97f9",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我要利用圣诞节高涨的能量\r\n来做特别的占卜──嗯？\r\n我的占卜跟圣诞节有什么关系吗？",
      "source_fingerprint": "8bfeefd508ad30cf827a93042e4c95cd620303a7a528cd8b1096cf264eb5e6f6",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1056",
        "10008"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:69e2264a9767904e2d1bb4b7",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "神灵之力充满了整条街道！\r\n为了一点不漏地接收下来，\r\n一起去收集吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "1f9dad24e5b3a28ef3d54a8fecd3331314fde145a426602fe4ba9e28255393d1",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1056",
        "10009"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7a39acec2118b7da7d7a9268",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "武运昌盛的是我们！",
      "source_fingerprint": "20c67a0ba5cc2fc657a2795857e6ee645784741ac3f8bfcdf0b64e26c65a01d7",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1056",
        "1001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:26946f5af9b0cf10a8c9c4ac",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我已经做好出门的准备了！\r\n今年一过完的瞬间，\r\n我们就立刻冲去做新年参拜吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "1afe8cd55d01c562d7b034fc8962b688e0373ff284804084caec699e99e41387",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1056",
        "10010"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:abc1c8e514ecca6551682074",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "生日快乐！\r\n为了祈求训练员一整年的幸福，\r\n我现在要开始献上独创的舞蹈！",
      "source_fingerprint": "f7feaa65082011c842918f01fdb28ee6f136cf2c5fade174943309a7a30bb9c2",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1056",
        "10011"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:27522e0225f81ea16932aa6a",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "为了「生日快乐，好运鲷下来」，\r\n我们一起吃鲷鱼烧吧！\r\n我还特别在上面撒了金粉哦～！",
      "source_fingerprint": "aca1a0a4fe624001c3fdb9ff53427b4ad502e67c5aae75f11d5025086f6aefec",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1056",
        "10012"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:bdd872246bdf93b621232795",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "没想到大家竟然会来帮我庆生……！\r\n呜……开心到眼睛都流出签文了！",
      "source_fingerprint": "65bd6c948b3ab0731318ab1f81dcbd9124e17110c36e87ffb94aba0776dee779",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1056",
        "10013"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b3c0972d44f98eec5ba0af8d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我算出今天的训练员\r\n要跟寿星在一起比较好！所以……\r\n今天要不要和我一起过呢！？",
      "source_fingerprint": "b6651a3e34b020131b3553d1f6f26c8e5e9eb7abb3ea354e5d237b70ddfce4f9",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1056",
        "10014"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:50fbb7d2a0a706ffccaa5a73",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "唔唔……！占卜的结果显示，\r\n好像收到了什么新的公告哦！\r\n去确认看看吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "a0f6534c9f53f73bb56470fb6b89b5b89cef7f32a647e7163791a2f29fd29ff0",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1056",
        "10015"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6f15c3955e8e434a5f7b0036",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "收到礼物了哦！\r\n会不会是什么开运道具呢！？",
      "source_fingerprint": "9fa5fccc5f35bb4de1063bb4c5e9c0e839d167c6de55315f84b96a188427ae21",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1056",
        "10016"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f2ae128e861071672d117741",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "任务达成，辛苦了！\r\n运气也正在上升当中！\r\n就照这个气势继续前进吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "e642c28431fcce86d4cb74fd11b49b73d6ce24a00f5437cecde0ba2ec57abc51",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1056",
        "10017"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:bd6fb4d7b3da550b997953f4",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "好像要办什么活动啊！\r\n要不要来占卜一下看看是什么活动？",
      "source_fingerprint": "3618f89840a6056f53f481926c4d86e559a482c84ca294a501d12c24828166b3",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1056",
        "10018"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7899b56876387afd4279690c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "活动开始了呢！\r\n占卜结果显示「参加为吉」哦！\r\n要不要去看看？",
      "source_fingerprint": "9fa561546d86b73c4fb9146908bd1bc88b81614fe2d0c486421f7e345f04ca3f",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1056",
        "10019"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:05f122c00f1599da0c4ef748",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "竟然输了！？",
      "source_fingerprint": "7d87de91fb9a167a2f3bb745d9d797263762c78606cc9bf8e432954bc9122f2b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1056",
        "1002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8f7b655ec26bd5ec719063cd",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "哦哦！这是！\r\n名册等级提升的卦象！",
      "source_fingerprint": "02509350c826f1306c1e532c32bd0c30484c892b76bf6743fd85bb345a0777f8",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1056",
        "10021"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:112eb6651c49b061037dfb34",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "蝴蝶结腰带是很方便的配件！\r\n因为有必要的时候，\r\n就可以绑成吉祥结！",
      "source_fingerprint": "492cd1b931928f5231a4c4a255c5254d0e401573270a9e5be8ce2265c3dee7ef",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1056",
        "10025"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:744788828c9be34486311211",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "直条纹可提升家族运势！我还曾经\r\n在穿着这件衣服时，达成将迷路的\r\n孩子送回其父母身边的成就！",
      "source_fingerprint": "358c5a28991f436889dd445ee8e4e39a40cba6a49770049299657ae22ddbd7ea",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1056",
        "10026"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:44eab792d8e37b9fb0cb5e4f",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "若没办法用衣服达到幸运色时，\r\n我就会借助外出地点的力量！\r\n例如森林的绿色或水族馆的蓝色！",
      "source_fingerprint": "e36213588b2d22e48ba63fd0202d15941e7db9dc90df574e5bb343629419d2db",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1056",
        "10027"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c162473b0b6905d20779701a",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "很厉害嘛。",
      "source_fingerprint": "1afaba4e3ecfb422b79f8ac8c1ed3290dbb333eb01a1c379e630dddca440efa7",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1056",
        "1003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a532a2538de71506fee6f404",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "这就是天命啊！",
      "source_fingerprint": "c1fbd6c35bc326fcc365ddafd878baa46b25674d303dbccc11ec6e30a8cb0c89",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1056",
        "1004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8ddce456808d5a5b72103c55",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "竟然输了！？",
      "source_fingerprint": "7d87de91fb9a167a2f3bb745d9d797263762c78606cc9bf8e432954bc9122f2b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1056",
        "1005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:eabe2d48ab6abf5a338dfe84",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "很厉害嘛。",
      "source_fingerprint": "1afaba4e3ecfb422b79f8ac8c1ed3290dbb333eb01a1c379e630dddca440efa7",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1056",
        "1006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e22cb4d223abd63be0143824",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "创下新纪录了哦──！",
      "source_fingerprint": "58e5efe701ee24fce1cdb1c31fd5ea7c1931f41ce3e2f1bce439ddc52c043d93",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1056",
        "1007"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:fbe212737386da95aec0c7c1",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "胜利女神是站在我这边的！",
      "source_fingerprint": "b423bf86c308486f8dffaef0cae4b85ff502e3cfe4210b2f185d7cd12773bc67",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1056",
        "1008"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1bc09ba068c87676d040107d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "Cygames",
      "source_fingerprint": "70f9f2ba202c631078563014e7f2f960d547e1d0cd4d1c18319f102cf5a87fcb",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1056",
        "11"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d95c037b8a55c2c3f04f5058",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "请研磨我的才能吧！\r\n就像是研磨水晶球那样！",
      "source_fingerprint": "857710c9270b330af5d8b8ae50f7fa5acd1d42869decb1853580a6627fc9a353",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1056",
        "110000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4f102b62d6115d5ee84aeaba",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "这里……有很多可以当作\r\n占卜参考的题材呢♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "0fcfc70c899b88658db94213d6d1b88dc65855d3d07d8f0a1629ebddd2edbd0e",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1056",
        "110001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:59242c87a7090f92dc3ddb06",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "用比赛试手气……可以哦！",
      "source_fingerprint": "626f13676beed07630d6a6640b4ad3e786f4647432858d17453b224ebd1518d2",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1056",
        "110002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:440364f2b8cce9b4997a8665",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我也替铃鹿同学祈祷了！",
      "source_fingerprint": "05aa3e21aae0876fa5639e0c7c728a15eee48003eda032f7546e4a3847ee825c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1056",
        "1117"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ade291175edb292493b27271",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "让我们发出胜利的欢呼声吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "6eeac5804787892c2b4f452a53f44dd788e5c58fdcc4dad40ca5fdedf3764c10",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1056",
        "1118"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0ea93eebd541e083319937da",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "南无，南无！",
      "source_fingerprint": "01631288c6bf74451f179f2d93cc1adfae34789c9c9b54d0cc9089f6e4f51336",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1056",
        "1135"
      ]
    }
  ]
}
